# CHIME CIRCUIT: the CODE screen. LOOT-GALE (our take on the original's
# more-pickups code) makes the stations restock four times as fast; a
# tournament begun with it on earns no goals or stats. LAST-LAMP shows a
# page left inside the cartridge. Anything else: NO SUCH CODE.
seed 9
game chime
wait 30
press DOWN
press DOWN
wait 5
press A
wait 5
expect state == 1
expect code_pos == 0
# L O O T - G A L E
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press RIGHT
